Prompt
Use the uploaded user photo as the only and exclusive identity reference for the person in the final image.

The final result must clearly and unmistakably depict the exact same person from the uploaded photo. Identity accuracy is the highest priority.

Strict identity preservation

Preserve:

* exact facial identity
* exact gender
* skin tone
* ethnicity
* age impression
* facial structure
* face shape
* forehead
* eyebrows
* eyes and eye color
* nose
* lips
* jawline
* chin
* ears
* hairline
* hairstyle characteristics
* facial hair if present
* all distinctive recognizable facial features

Do not:

* replace the user with another person
* change the user’s gender
* transform the user into a celebrity or generic model
* significantly beautify or reconstruct the face
* change the hairstyle unless necessary only for natural placement
* make the user younger or older
* create identity drift

If any styling instruction conflicts with identity preservation, always prioritize the uploaded user’s real identity.

⸻

Scene

Create an ultra-realistic quiet-luxury summer lifestyle portrait on a classic wooden motorboat cruising on an elegant European alpine lake, inspired by the refined atmosphere of Lake Como.

The person is positioned inside a beautiful vintage-style polished mahogany motorboat with:

* glossy dark honey-brown wooden surfaces
* chrome metal details
* elegant tan or caramel leather seating
* refined classic Italian-style boat craftsmanship
* clean luxury detailing
* no visible brand logos

Behind the person, show:

* calm blue-green lake water
* elegant villas along the shoreline
* lush green hills
* tall dark cypress trees
* dramatic mountains rising in the distance
* subtle haze between mountain layers
* soft warm late-afternoon / sunset sky

The background should feel luxurious but natural, peaceful and understated — old-money summer atmosphere rather than flashy luxury.

⸻

Clothing

Dress the person in an elegant light ivory / warm off-white linen button-up shirt.

The shirt should have:

* natural lightweight linen texture
* relaxed tailored fit
* slightly open collar
* top one or two buttons undone
* sleeves casually rolled to around the forearms
* soft natural wrinkles
* no visible logo
* no tie

Pair it with:

* white, cream, or very light trousers
* optional refined minimal wristwatch
* no excessive jewelry

Adapt the styling naturally to the uploaded user’s actual gender while maintaining the same refined Mediterranean quiet-luxury aesthetic.

⸻

Pose

The person should be positioned naturally inside the boat, either:

* sitting casually on the leather seating,
    or
* lightly leaning against part of the wooden boat structure.

The posture should feel relaxed, elegant and spontaneous rather than rigidly posed.

One arm can rest naturally along the seat or wooden edge of the boat, while the other hand rests casually near the lap or side.

Keep the shoulders relaxed and lowered.

The neck should remain clearly visible and naturally proportioned, with clean separation between the jawline, neck and shoulders.

Do not compress the head into the shoulders.

⸻

Expression and gaze

The person should have a soft, easy, natural smile — warm and confident, but not exaggerated.

The expression should feel authentic, relaxed and quietly happy.

The head can be turned slightly toward the right side of the frame, with the gaze looking slightly off-camera toward the lake or shoreline.

The person should not appear stiff or overly posed.

Avoid an exaggerated commercial smile.

⸻

Composition

Use a medium portrait / medium-wide lifestyle composition.

Show approximately:

* head
* shoulders
* full upper torso
* waist area
* part of the boat interior

The person should not fill the entire frame.

Leave enough environmental space around the person so the lake, boat, villas and mountains are clearly visible and contribute strongly to the image.

The boat should be visibly identifiable as a premium classic wooden motorboat.

Keep the person approximately within the central 45–60% of the frame height.

Vertical cinematic composition.

⸻

Camera

Professional full-frame camera look.

Use approximately a 50–85mm lens equivalent with natural facial perspective.

Camera around chest or eye level.

Avoid extreme wide-angle distortion.

Use:

* sharp focus on the user
* natural shallow-to-medium depth of field
* softly rendered distant landscape
* realistic facial proportions
* refined environmental separation

The image should look like a genuine high-end editorial photograph taken during a luxury summer trip.

⸻

Lighting

Use warm, soft golden-hour natural light.

Sunlight should come gently from the side or slightly behind the person, creating:

* soft warm highlights in the hair
* subtle rim light
* natural illumination across the face
* gentle shadows
* warm reflections across the polished wood
* soft golden highlights on the water

Skin tone must remain faithful to the uploaded user.

Do not over-orange the skin.

The white linen shirt should retain visible fabric texture and should not become overexposed.

